{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030033431322-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030040607\"/><p>意外受傷男子坐在梯級上接受治理。</p><p>今日(30日)凌晨3時許，一名20餘歲外籍男子，在中區蘭桂坊消遺後離開，當步至德己立街一公廁對開，他疑飲醉酒腳步浮浮，撼向一閘門致頭部受傷淌血，有市民見狀上前施救，並報案求助。救護員到場將清醒事主送往瑪麗醫院治理。案件列「醉酒人發現」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T20:20:38.612454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T19:34:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.111636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:25.441905+00:00","content_hash":"f1d4233ff9f02ebb7f28b03203a425d6cf6a6afd29e5519e50feb977d0a39d14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T20:20:38.612454+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}